config BR2_PACKAGE_OABENCHV2
	bool "oabenchv2"
	help
	OABench 2.0 is a second-generation suite of benchmarks that 
	allows the user to approximate the performance of processors in 
	printers, plotters, and other office automation systems that 
	handle text and image processing tasks.
	
	  https://github.com/eembc/oabenchv2

